                        "review": "I absolutely love this game. Grew up watching these games on youtube and playing is just as fun. \n\nFor anyone stuck at the beginning, don't give up. You have to [spoiler] avoid doing all of the tasks. It's a trick. You have to look at the clocks in the downstairs hallway next to the glass doors, and go upstairs and find the pictures with the red dots. Click on the painting with the number of dots that correlates to the time. Then use that keycard to open the glass doors to wake up from the nightmare. Then you can proceed with doing the tasks and leave your apartment.  [/spoiler]\n\nMy latest playthrough was made even better by playing in VR. It's a bit rough around the edges and you gotta play with a controller but it was still really awesome. I recorded it for my channel if anyone would like to check it out:\n\nhttps://www.youtube.com/watch?v=-rpAjkAt7Gg&t=22s",
